  <!--EN: Create the Archotech centipede. The process will take about 15 days, and the energy signature will be detectable from a long distance away.-->
  <GR_BeginArchotechCentipedeDesc>创建 Archotech 蜈蚣。该过程大约需要 15 天，并且可以从很远的距离检测到能量信号。</GR_BeginArchotechCentipedeDesc>
  <!--EN: You are ready to start the archotech centipede project.\n\nThe process will take about 15 days, and the energy signature will be detectable from a long distance away. This sort of energy signature indicates that someone is meddling in technology that is far beyond human understanding, and will attract gangs of desperate raiders and swarms of deadly mechanoids.\n\nYou will be assaulted with an intensity you've never seen. Make sure your defenses are prepared first.-->
  <GR_BeginArchotechCentipedeText>您已准备好启动 archotech 蜈蚣项目。

该过程大约需要 15 天，并且可以从很远的距离检测到能量信号。这种能量信号表明有人正在干预远远超出人类理解的技术，并将吸引绝望的袭击者团伙和致命的机械人群。

你将受到前所未有的强度攻击。确保首先准备好防御。</GR_BeginArchotechCentipedeText>
