  <!--EN: Disable the pop up message that appears when a growth cell is finished by a genomorpher-->
  <GR_DisableGrowthCellAlertsTooltip>禁用基因形态完成生长细胞时出现的弹出消息</GR_DisableGrowthCellAlertsTooltip>
  <!--EN: Disable "Roaming monstrosities" raids-->
  <GR_DisableHybridRaids>禁用“漫游怪物”袭击</GR_DisableHybridRaids>
  <!--EN: Disables the roaming, manhunting hybrids attacking your colony periodically-->
  <GR_DisableHybridRaidsTooltip>禁止漫游、狩猎的杂种定期攻击你的殖民地</GR_DisableHybridRaidsTooltip>
  <!--EN: Disable mech hybrid IFF sensors-->
  <GR_DisableMechanoidIFF>禁用机械混合 IFF 传感器</GR_DisableMechanoidIFF>
  <!--EN: Disable mechanoid hybrids having a need for a mechahybrid antenna. With this setting ON, mechanoid hybrids will always remain tamed (with base game animal trainability mechanics still present) and you won't need to build any mechahybrid antennas, ever.-->
  <GR_DisableMechanoidIFFTooltip>禁用需要机械混合天线的机械混合系统。启用此设置后，机械混合体将始终保持驯服状态（基本游戏动物可训练机制仍然存在），并且您永远不需要构建任何机械混合体天线。</GR_DisableMechanoidIFFTooltip>
  <!--EN: Disable all genetic diseases-->
  <GR_DisableOldAgeDiseases>禁用所有遗传病</GR_DisableOldAgeDiseases>
  <!--EN: Disables all genetic diseases that afflict the hybrids after a given time, depending on their quality. Bear in mind that this effectively means the hybrids won't ever die of old age, as they don't receive "old age" diseases such as dementia.-->
  <GR_DisableOldAgeDiseasesTooltip>在给定时间后禁用所有影响杂交种的遗传疾病，具体取决于它们的质量。请记住，这实际上意味着混血儿永远不会死于老年，因为它们不会患上痴呆症等“老年”疾病。</GR_DisableOldAgeDiseasesTooltip>
