  <!--EN: Defines the radius that "Abandoned Lab" quests' random hybrid spawners use to detect player around them and spawn a random hostile hybrid. Default is 12 tiles. WARNING: Cranking this up to 40 is laggy, as the number of tiles in a circle raises exponentially by radius, not linearly.-->
